#. type: heading1
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "DIRENV-FETCHURL 1 \"2019\" direnv \"User Manuals\""
msgstr "DIRENV-FETCHURL 1 \"2019\" direnv 「利用者用マニュアル」"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:4 ../man/direnv.toml.1.md:4
#: ../man/direnv-stdlib.1.md:4 ../man/direnv.1.md:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "名称"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "direnv fetchurl - Fetch a URL to disk"
msgstr "direnv fetchurl - URLから取得して保存"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:9 ../man/direnv-stdlib.1.md:9
#: ../man/direnv.1.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "処方"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:12
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "*direnv fetchurl* <url> [<integrity-hash>]\n"
msgid "*direnv fetchurl* <url> \\[<integrity-hash>\\]"
msgstr "*direnv fetchurl* <URL> [<正統性のためのハッシュ>]\n"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:14 ../man/direnv.toml.1.md:9
#: ../man/direnv-stdlib.1.md:14 ../man/direnv.1.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "解説"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command downloads the given URL into a fixed disk location, based on the content of the retrieved file."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは与えられたURLからダウンロードして決まった場所に保存します。\n"
"場所は取得されたファイルの内容に基づきます。"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:20
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "This has been introduced to avoid a dependency on `curl` or `wget`, while also\n"
#| "promoting a more secure way to fetch data from the Internet. Use this instead\n"
#| "of `curl <url> | sh`.\n"
msgid "This has been introduced to avoid a dependency on `curl` or `wget`, while also promoting a more secure way to fetch data from the Internet. Use this instead of `curl <url> | sh`."
msgstr ""
"この機能は`curl`や`wget`への依存を避けるために導入されました。\n"
"インターネットからより安全にデータを取得する方法を促進するものでもあります。\n"
"`curl <URL> | sh`の代わりにお使いください。\n"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command has two modes of operation:"
msgstr "このコマンドには2つの操作モードがあります。"

#. type: ordered list (period delim) / item / paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Just pass the URL to discover the integrity hash."
msgstr "単にURLを渡し、正統性のためのハッシュを調べます。"

#. type: ordered list (period delim) / item / paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass the URL *and* the integrity hash to get back the on-disk location."
msgstr "URL *と* 正統性のためのハッシュを渡し、ディスク上の場所を返します。"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since the on-disk location is based on the hash, it also acts as a cache. One implication of this design is that URLs must be stable and always return the same content."
msgstr ""
"ディスク上の場所はハッシュに基づくため、キャッシュとしてもはたらきます。\n"
"この設計では暗に、URLが安定で常に同じ内容を返すものとしています。"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Downloaded files are marked as read-only and executable so it can also be used to fetch and execute static binaries."
msgstr "ダウンロードされたファイルは読取のみ実行可能となるため、静的バイナリを取得して実行することにも使えます。"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "オプション"

#. type: html_block
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:39
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<url>\n"
#| "    A HTTP URL that returns content on HTTP GET requests. 301 and other\n"
#| "    redirects are followed.\n"
msgid ""
"<url>\n"
"    A HTTP URL that returns content on HTTP GET requests. 301 and other\n"
"    redirects are followed."
msgstr ""
"<URL>\n"
"    HTTPのURLで、HTTPのGET要求で内容を返すものです。\n"
"    301やその他のリダイレクトには従います。\n"

#. type: html_block
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:43
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<integrity-hash>\n"
#| "    When passed, the integrity of the retrieved content will be validated\n"
#| "    against the given hash. The hash encoding is based on the SRI W3C\n"
#| "    specification (see https://www.w3.org/TR/SRI/ ).\n"
msgid ""
"<integrity-hash>\n"
"    When passed, the integrity of the retrieved content will be validated\n"
"    against the given hash. The hash encoding is based on the SRI W3C\n"
"    specification (see https://www.w3.org/TR/SRI/ )."
msgstr ""
"<正統性のためのハッシュ>\n"
"    これを渡したとき、取得された内容の正統性が与えられたハッシュで検証されます。\n"
"    ハッシュの符号化はSRIのW3C仕様に基づきます（ https://www.w3.org/TR/SRI/ 参照）。\n"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "OUTPUT"
msgstr "出力"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:51
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "*direnv fetchurl* outputs different content based on the argument.\n"
msgid "*direnv fetchurl* outputs different content based on the argument."
msgstr "*direnv fetchurl* は引数によって異なる内容を出力します。\n"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the `integrity-hash` is being passed, it will output the path to the on-disk location, if the retrieval was successful."
msgstr "`正統性のためのハッシュ` が渡されたとき、その取得に成功したら、ディスク上の場所のパスを出力します。"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "If only the `url` is being passed, it will output the hash as well as some human-readable instruction. If stdout is not a tty, only the hash will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"`url`だけが渡されたら、ハッシュと人間が読みやすい説明が出力されます。\n"
"標準出力がttyでなければ、ハッシュだけが表示されます。"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:60 ../man/direnv.1.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLE"
msgstr "例"

#. type: code_block
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:63
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "      direnv fetchurl \"https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.7/install\" \"sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc/U30Igh/pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds=\"\n"
#| "      #=> /home/zimbatm/.cache/direnv/cas/sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc_U30Igh_pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds=\n"
msgid ""
"$ ./direnv fetchurl https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.7/install\n"
"Found hash: sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc/U30Igh/pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds=\n"
"\n"
"Invoke fetchurl again with the hash as an argument to get the disk location:\n"
"\n"
"  direnv fetchurl \"https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.7/install\" \"sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc/U30Igh/pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds=\"\n"
"  #=> /home/zimbatm/.cache/direnv/cas/sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc_U30Igh_pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds="
msgstr ""
"      direnv fetchurl \"https://releases.nixos.org/nix/nix-2.3.7/install\" \"sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc/U30Igh/pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds=\"\n"
"      #=> /home/zimbatm/.cache/direnv/cas/sha256-7Gxl5GzI9juc_U30Igh_pY+p6+gj5Waohfwql3jHIds=\n"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
msgstr "環境変数"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:74
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "**XDG_CACHE_HOME**\n"
#| "    This variable is used to select the on-disk location of the fetched URLs\n"
#| "    as `$XDG_CACHE_HOME/direnv/cas`. If **XDG_CACHE_HOME** is unset or empty,\n"
#| "    defaults to `$HOME/.cache`.\n"
msgid "**XDG\\_CACHE\\_HOME** This variable is used to select the on-disk location of the fetched URLs as `$XDG_CACHE_HOME/direnv/cas`. If **XDG\\_CACHE\\_HOME** is unset or empty, defaults to `$HOME/.cache`."
msgstr ""
"**XDG_CACHE_HOME**\n"
"    この変数は取得されたURLのディスク上の場所を`$XDG_CACHE_HOME/direnv/cas`のように選択するときに使います。\n"
"    **XDG_CACHE_HOME** が未設定ないし空のときは、既定で`$HOME/.cache`になります。\n"

#. type: heading2
#: ../man/direnv-fetchurl.1.md:79 ../man/direnv.toml.1.md:136
#: ../man/direnv-stdlib.1.md:469 ../man/direnv.1.md:244 ../README.md:195
