#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv.1.md:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "`direnv deny [PATH_TO_RC]` : Revokes the authorization of a given .envrc or .env file."
msgstr "`direnv deny [rcへのパス]` : 与えられた.envrcや.envファイルの認可を失効させます。"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv.1.md:144
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "`direnv edit [PATH_TO_RC]` : Opens PATH_TO_RC or the current .envrc or .env into an $EDITOR and allow the file to be loaded afterwards."
