#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv.1.md:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "`direnv export SHELL` : Loads an .envrc or .env and prints the diff in terms of exports. Supported shells: bash, zsh, fish, tcsh, elvish, pwsh, murex, json, vim, gha (GitHub Actions), gzenv, systemd."
msgstr "`direnv export シェル` : .envrcないし.envを読み込み、エクスポートで使える差分を印字します。対応しているシェルは、bash, zsh, fish, tcsh, elvish, pwsh, murex, json, vim, gha (GitHub Actions), gzenv, systemdです。"

#. type: paragraph
#: ../man/direnv.1.md:153
